@node SCUMM Frontend
@chapter SCUMM Frontend Language

SCUMM (Script Creation Utility for Maniac Mansion) is a scripting language
designed for adventure game development, originally used in LucasArts games.
The EIGHTBOL SCUMM frontend enables SCUMM scripts to be compiled for 8-bit and
16-bit retro platforms. This chapter documents the complete SCUMM language,
including lexical elements, grammar, statements, expressions, type system,
and comprehensive AST mappings.

